ext\": \"Provide reports that answer operational comparisons such as highest pen consumption, best lot FCR, highest lot ADG, most-used ration, feeding-plan alignment, over- or under-feeding, remaining inventory, and feed cost per unit of gain.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Allow users to filter relevant dashboard and report data by date range and available lot, pen, breed, sex, or other supported attributes; update displayed results to reflect the selected filters.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Provide a feed-to-gain report comparing ADG, FCR, and cost of gain across lots, and allow users to export the current report and filters as CSV or PDF.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"If filters yield no records or a metric cannot be calculated for a lot, show an empty or unavailable state with an explanation; do not substitute zero for missing performance data.\",\n      \"kind\": \"error\"\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"I-10\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Provide clearly identified mock procurement, receiving, lot, pen, inventory, ration, feeding, and weight data that users can load to exercise the end-to-end PO-to-performance workflows without representing the sample records as real operational data.\",\n      \"kind\": \"data\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Provide a demo view or presentation content covering the proposed solution and architecture, an architecture diagram, app demo flow, validation/testing approach and results, challenges, production-readiness assessment, and go-to-market strategy and analysis.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Allow the demo or mock-data workflow to be reset or reloaded so a user can repeat the demonstration without leaving stale sample transactions that distort the displayed results.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"readingChosen\": \"I interpret the requested deliverables as content and demo flows available in the responsive web app, including mock data, rather than requiring a separate native app or an external presentation file.\"\n   }\n  ]\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\n<artifact id=\"differences\" kind=\"differences\" sha=\"\">\n[\n {\n  \"id\": \"D-1\",\n  \"span\": \"I-1\",\n  \"topic\": \"Import sources and synchronization\",\n  \"readings\": [\n   {\n    \"sketch\": 1,\n    \"behaviour\": 0,\n    \"summary\": \"Allows import from a connected source or uploaded data file.\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"sketch\": 2,\n    \"behaviour\": 0,\n    \"summary\": \"Specifies import or synchronization from PO and receiving records, without stating uploaded-file support.\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"sketch\": 3,\n    \"behaviour\": 0,\n    \"summary\": \"Describes importing records but does not specify connected-source synchronization or file-upload options.\"\n   }\n  ]\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"D-2\",\n  \"span\": \"I-3\",\n  \"topic\": \"Inventory stock adjustments\",\n  \"readings\": [\n   {\n    \"sketch\": 1,\n    \"behaviour\": 1,\n    \"summary\": \"Tracks opening stock, receipts, consumption, wastage, and closing stock as dated movements.\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"sketch\": 2,\n    \"behaviour\": 1,\n    \"summary\": \"Tracks opening stock, receipts, consumption, and closing stock, without listing wastage as a movement.\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"sketch\": 3,\n    \"behaviour\": 1,\n    \"summary\": \"Tracks receipts, consumption, adjustments, and wastage as dated movements.\"\n   }\n  ]\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"D-3\",\n  \"span\": \"I-4\",\n  \"topic\": \"Ration candidate generation and saving\",\n  \"readings\": [\n   {\n    \"sketch\": 1,\n    \"behaviour\": 2,\n    \"summary\": \"Compares candidate rations against nutritional/animal constraints and identifies the lower-cost eligible mix.\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"sketch\": 2,\n    \"behaviour\": 1,\n    \"summary\": \"Allows users to request economical candidate mixes and review their